#. fr: L'attraction <switch $n1><case>“Mascotte en détresse”<case>“Attention, fragile”<case>“Sus à l'imp-osteur”<case>“Voulez-vous danser<nbsp>?”<case>“Un sacré courant d'air”<case>“Haute voltige”<case>“As de l'air”<case>“La coupe est pleine”</switch> se déroule ac<shy>tu<shy>el<shy>le<shy>ment au <switch $n2><case>square des merveilles<case>square des spectacles<case>square du rond-point<case>comptoir du Méga Cactpot</switch>. Dépêchez-vous de participer<nbsp>!
#. macro: <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = global number 4 (1 when the player character is female, 0 when male) (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>Cliffhanger<case>Vase Off<case>Skinchange We Can Believe In<case>The Time of My Life<case>Any Way the Wind Blows<case>Leap of Faith<case>Air F… — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n2><case>Wonder Square East<case>Event Square<case>Round Square<case>the Cactpot Board</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 2 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
msgctxt "custom/002/CmnGscGATENotice_00242:TEXT_CMNGSCGATENOTICE_00242_GATE_IN_SESSION:1"
msgid "Greetings, <if $gn4>madam<else>sir</if>! If you wish to participate in “<switch $n1><case>Cliffhanger<case>Vase Off<case>Skinchange We Can Believe In<case>The Time of My Life<case>Any Way the Wind Blows<case>Leap of Faith<case>Air Force One<case>The Slice Is Right</switch>,” pray make haste to <switch $n2><case>Wonder Square East<case>Event Square<case>Round Square<case>the Cactpot Board</switch>!"
msgstr ""

